apps/server/src/repeat-guard.ts adapts OpenMausBot's server/drivers/chat-repeat-guard.ts (the per-call repeat
guard) and the English rules of server/drivers/chat-announcement.ts (spotting a reply that announces an action
without calling a tool). Changes: Taurus's wording, a lower stop limit for Taurus's shorter loop, no Chinese-language
rules, and "I'll" alone is not treated as an announcement because Taurus's persona states defaults that way.

The loop limits, the announcement nudge, corrective rounds only for local models, and ok/false tool results in
apps/server/src/agent.ts follow the design of OpenMausBot's server/drivers/openai-chat.ts; no code was copied from
that file.


Nūs Desktop (potlakai/nus-desktop)
Source: https://github.com/potlakai/nus-desktop/tree/592e30f40241ea98247759591bb5d0ce7f7a051a
apps/server/src/speech-queue.ts adapts src/transcription-queue.js: typed final-only jobs, bounded FIFO, failures reject instead of returning error objects.
apps/server/src/brain.ts (fileText) adapts the modification-time-and-size text cache idea from companion/src/context-pack.js; no code or prompt rules from it are copied. No Nus assets, providers, telemetry, subscriptions or speech engines are imported.

